OL,3,AWhat we know about the global Microsoft
OL,4,Aoutage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major global Microsoft outage has
OL,7,Fcaused problems, or in some cases
OL,8,Fdisabled entire services. including
OL,9,Femails and artificial intelligence
OL,10,Fproducts.
OL,12,FReports of problems with the email
OL,13,Fprovider Outlook peaked globally at
OL,14,Fnearly 140,000 around 18:00 GMT on
OL,15,FThursday, according to monitoring
OL,16,Fwebsite Downdetector.
OL,18,FMicrosoft has said the outage was not
OL,19,Fcaused by a cyber-security incident,
OL,20,Fbut efforts to fix the issues have so
OL,21,Ffar been largely unsuccessful.
